{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_2EA2C6EA95FB87C28CC7","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第三十三条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第三十三条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第三十三条","quote":"主刑的种类如下：\n（一）管制；\n（二）拘役；\n（三）有期徒刑；\n（四）无期徒刑；\n（五）死刑。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_AA46662A33BE8641F548","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第三十二条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第三十二条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第三十二条","quote":"刑罚分为主刑和附加刑。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_3BBB7D6D8F6B7DB10876","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第三十五条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第三十五条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第三十五条","quote":"对于犯罪的外国人，可以独立适用或者附加适用驱逐出境。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_25C04858C72133C78C04","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第三十四条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第三十四条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第三十四条","quote":"附加刑的种类如下：\n（一）罚金；\n（二）剥夺政治权利；\n（三）没收财产。\n附加刑也可以独立适用。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_4C8C7E851C8C9E9A34B1","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第三条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第三条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第三条","quote":"法律明文规定为犯罪行为的，依照法律定罪处刑；法律没有明文规定为犯罪行为的，不得定罪处刑。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_F5C8417799029DB6D59D","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第二十一条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第二十一条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第二十一条","quote":"为了使国家、公共利益、本人或者他人的人身、财产和其他权利免受正在发生的危险，不得已采取的紧急避险行为，造成损害的，不负刑事责任。\n紧急避险超过必要限度造成不应有的损害的，应当负刑事责任，但是应当减轻或者免除处罚。\n第一款中关于避免本人危险的规定，不适用于职务上、业务上负有特定责任的人。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_AEA7E2482762FA851DBE","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第二十七条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第二十七条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第二十七条","quote":"在共同犯罪中起次要或者辅助作用的，是从犯。\n对于从犯，应当从轻、减轻处罚或者免除处罚。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_ABD30E38770107F4425D","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第二十三条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第二十三条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第二十三条","quote":"已经着手实行犯罪，由于犯罪分子意志以外的原因而未得逞的，是犯罪未遂。\n对于未遂犯，可以比照既遂犯从轻或者减轻处罚。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_9B50DD8B0D1BFBBEEC77","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第二十九条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第二十九条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第二十九条","quote":"教唆他人犯罪的，应当按照他在共同犯罪中所起的作用处罚。教唆不满十八周岁的人犯罪的，应当从重处罚。\n如果被教唆的人没有犯被教唆的罪，对于教唆犯，可以从轻或者减轻处罚。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_4C089DD82C4E65798773","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第二十二条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第二十二条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第二十二条","quote":"为了犯罪，准备工具、制造条件的，是犯罪预备。\n对于预备犯，可以比照既遂犯从轻、减轻处罚或者免除处罚。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_0A9746B8A9FAE75CA992","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第二十五条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第二十五条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第二十五条","quote":"共同犯罪是指二人以上共同故意犯罪。\n二人以上共同过失犯罪，不以共同犯罪论处；应当负刑事责任的，按照他们所犯的罪分别处罚。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_7A96E1BD8374ED91F91A","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第二十八条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第二十八条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第二十八条","quote":"对于被胁迫参加犯罪的，应当按照他的犯罪情节减轻处罚或者免除处罚。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_58C57A399FEB3E8A912C","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第二十六条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第二十六条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第二十六条","quote":"组织、领导犯罪集团进行犯罪活动的或者在共同犯罪中起主要作用的，是主犯。\n三人以上为共同实施犯罪而组成的较为固定的犯罪组织，是犯罪集团。\n对组织、领导犯罪集团的首要分子，按照集团所犯的全部罪行处罚。\n对于第三款规定以外的主犯，应当按照其所参与的或者组织、指挥的全部犯罪处罚。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_4ABDA234E366E975E9C4","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第二十四条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第二十四条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第二十四条","quote":"在犯罪过程中，自动放弃犯罪或者自动有效地防止犯罪结果发生的，是犯罪中止。\n对于中止犯，没有造成损害的，应当免除处罚；造成损害的，应当减轻处罚。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_9CB6894B3E55465B19C6","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第二十条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第二十条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第二十条","quote":"为了使国家、公共利益、本人或者他人的人身、财产和其他权利免受正在进行的不法侵害，而采取的制止不法侵害的行为，对不法侵害人造成损害的，属于正当防卫，不负刑事责任。\n正当防卫明显超过必要限度造成重大损害的，应当负刑事责任，但是应当减轻或者免除处罚。\n对正在进行行凶、杀人、抢劫、强奸、绑架以及其他严重危及人身安全的暴力犯罪，采取防卫行为，造成不法侵害人伤亡的，不属于防卫过当，不负刑事责任。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_739F98E83E2A8E71CE61","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第二百六十三条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第二百六十三条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第二百六十三条","quote":"以暴力、胁迫或者其他方法抢劫公私财物的，处三年以上十年以下有期徒刑，并处罚金；有下列情形之一的，处十年以上有期徒刑、无期徒刑或者死刑，并处罚金或者没收财产：\n（一）入户抢劫的；\n（二）在公共交通工具上抢劫的；\n（三）抢劫银行或者其他金融机构的；\n（四）多次抢劫或者抢劫数额巨大的；\n（五）抢劫致人重伤、死亡的；\n（六）冒充军警人员抢劫的；\n（七）持枪抢劫的；\n（八）抢劫军用物资或者抢险、救灾、救济物资的。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_8E9A87FF363B6FAB8D94","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第十七条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第十七条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第十七条","quote":"已满十六周岁的人犯罪，应当负刑事责任。\n已满十四周岁不满十六周岁的人，犯故意杀人、故意伤害致人重伤或者死亡、强奸、抢劫、贩卖毒品、放火、爆炸、投放危险物质罪的，应当负刑事责任。\n已满十二周岁不满十四周岁的人，犯故意杀人、故意伤害罪，致人死亡或者以特别残忍手段致人重伤造成严重残疾，情节恶劣，经最高人民检察院核准追诉的，应当负刑事责任。\n对依照前三款规定追究刑事责任的不满十八周岁的人，应当从轻或者减轻处罚。\n因不满十六周岁不予刑事处罚的，责令其父母或者其他监护人加以管教；在必要的时候，依法进行专门矫治教育。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_91B7361E398CE941C6F1","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第十三条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第十三条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第十三条","quote":"一切危害国家主权、领土完整和安全，分裂国家、颠覆人民民主专政的政权和推翻社会主义制度，破坏社会秩序和经济秩序，侵犯国有财产或者劳动群众集体所有的财产，侵犯公民私人所有的财产，侵犯公民的人身权利、民主权利和其他权利，以及其他危害社会的行为，依照法律应当受刑罚处罚的，都是犯罪，但是情节显著轻微危害不大的，不认为是犯罪。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_884FC4550E1F5A30DACE","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第十二条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第十二条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第十二条","quote":"中华人民共和国成立以后本法施行以前的行为，如果当时的法律不认为是犯罪的，适用当时的法律；如果当时的法律认为是犯罪的，依照本法总则第四章第八节的规定应当追诉的，按照当时的法律追究刑事责任，但是如果本法不认为是犯罪或者处刑较轻的，适用本法。\n本法施行以前，依照当时的法律已经作出的生效判决，继续有效。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_C375F6EF7328C16EEA64","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第十五条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第十五条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第十五条","quote":"应当预见自己的行为可能发生危害社会的结果，因为疏忽大意而没有预见，或者已经预见而轻信能够避免，以致发生这种结果的，是过失犯罪。\n过失犯罪，法律有规定的才负刑事责任。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_57582BE968658D263230","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第十六条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第十六条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第十六条","quote":"行为在客观上虽然造成了损害结果，但是不是出于故意或者过失，而是由于不能抗拒或者不能预见的原因所引起的，不是犯罪。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
{"schema_version":"evidence-pack-item-v1","evidence_id":"EVID_15133B1349471D46D951","source_type":"法律条文","document_id":"xingfa:第十四条","title":"中华人民共和国刑法第十四条","source_title":"中华人民共和国刑法","article_ref":"第十四条","quote":"明知自己的行为会发生危害社会的结果，并且希望或者放任这种结果发生，因而构成犯罪的，是故意犯罪。\n故意犯罪，应当负刑事责任。","authority_level":"法律","effective_from":"2024-03-01","effective_to":null,"effective_status":"effective_as_of_download_snapshot","source_url":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/","source_url_scope":"official_portal_only","source_snapshot_id":"npc-flk-2026-02-26-xingfa-amendment-12","source_bundle_sha256":"42ab93f764e3dd0c0f2479db94f5e6e4b73455317cc5dfc2ad47e003fc005875","risk_flags":["official_item_url_not_preserved","recheck_validity_before_classroom_term"]}
